41
00:02:26.172 --> 00:02:28.132
We are right now... December is the deadline.

42
00:02:28.132 --> 00:02:31.132
Of course, our government is going to be a bit slow because we

43
00:02:31.132 --> 00:02:34.332
were writing a draft law a couple of months back and then the new

44
00:02:34.332 --> 00:02:37.492
cabinet just threw it into the bin and now it's going to write a new

