00:02:37.492 --> 00:02:42.012
law, but it's also important to know for those of you that

46
00:02:42.012 --> 00:02:46.252
are software developers working for companies

47
00:02:46.252 --> 00:02:50.052
that are going to be obliged to rely on the data from the digital

48
