identity wallets. And these are banks, these are other

49
00:02:53.972 --> 00:02:57.322
financial institutions, these are couriers,

50
00:02:57.772 --> 00:03:03.052
these are very large online platforms such as online shops and

51
00:03:03.052 --> 00:03:06.292
whatnot. So, if you are a part of their supply chain,

52
00:03:06.292 --> 00:03:12.492
you need to know that they would need to have a form of, I

53
00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:18.012
would say, a proxy towards the wallet that can actually read data

54
00:03:18.012 --> 00:03:21.972
from the wallet and feed this data into the corporate system.

55
00:03:21.972 --> 00:03:24.652
So, when you go into a bank and you want to authenticate with the

56
00:03:24.652 --> 00:03:28.012
wallet, it's going to be a requirement for the bank to acknowledge

57
00:03:28.012 --> 00:03:33.012
your wallet and take identity proofs about you through this

58
00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:35.492
wallet even if the bank has another system.

59
00:03:35.492 --> 00:03:38.252
And this obligation is going to kick in next year,

60
00:03:38.252 --> 00:03:42.332
so less than 12 months for all these relying parties to prepare

61
00:03:42.332 --> 00:03:47.372
themselves and be able to get data from the individual

62
00:03:47.372 --> 00:03:50.652
person's wallet. By the way, individuals are not going to be obliged

63
00:03:50.652 --> 00:03:53.452
to have a wallet. It's going to be a choice on their end,

64
00:03:53.452 --> 00:03:56.732
but it's going to be a requirement on the end of the relying parties

65
00:03:56.732 --> 00:04:00.852
that, per national law or international law, are required to

66
00:04:00.852 --> 00:04:05.774
execute strong user authentication or strong customer authentication

67
00:04:05.774 --> 00:04:10.334
in the financial world. I already spoke about some of the use

68
00:04:10.334 --> 00:04:15.734
cases. As I mentioned, all the government services would need to

69
00:04:15.734 --> 00:04:18.774
implement it. Banking would need to implement it.

70
00:04:18.774 --> 00:04:22.364
Businesses would need to actually provide controlled access.

71
00:04:22.814 --> 00:04:25.574
No more free social media for children.

72
00:04:25.574 --> 00:04:27.454
It doesn't matter whether you think it's good or not.

73
00:04:27.454 --> 00:04:29.814
It's not going to happen anymore.

74
00:04:29.814 --> 00:04:32.694
I mean, it's decided at international level.

75
00:04:32.694 --> 00:04:36.764
So, the European digital identity wallets would also be provided to

