00:05:23.294 --> 00:05:27.734
diploma, it's going to bypass all the checks that can take

87
00:05:27.734 --> 00:05:30.974
months if not years. Why am I saying this?

88
00:05:30.974 --> 00:05:35.534
Because it's very practical for those that have businesses in the

89
00:05:35.534 --> 00:05:39.414
field of tourism or develop applications in the field of tourism,

90
00:05:39.414 --> 00:05:41.244
also in the field of travel.

91
00:05:41.774 --> 00:05:44.604
Doesn't matter if it's maritime or

92
00:05:45.654 --> 00:05:51.404
any other form of travel or cargo, flights.

93
00:05:52.054 --> 00:05:56.614
What is important is that all of these industries will benefit from

94
00:05:56.614 --> 00:06:01.414
numerous use cases which are elaborated over the last couple of

95
00:06:01.414 --> 00:06:04.254
years within these large-scale pilots.

96
